 "title": "30 V, 2.5 A N-channel trench MOSFET in SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.0",
  "pages": 5
 },
 "summary": "An N-channel enhancement MOSFET built on a trench process, in the three-lead SOT-23. It is rated 30 V drain to source, ±12 V gate to source, 2.5 A continuous and 16 A pulsed drain current. On-resistance is at most 50 mΩ with 10 V of gate drive, 58 mΩ at 4.5 V and 90 mΩ at 2.5 V, and the gate threshold lies between 0.65 V and 1.5 V. It is offered as a small switch for battery-powered equipment, solid-state relays and logic-level drive.",
 "key_figures": [
